The MIT License above covers the source code and documentation of this repository only.
Character artwork under shell/pets/ is third-party material licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see shell/pets/LICENSE
and shell/pets/CREDITS.md). Copyright of that artwork belongs to its respective authors and it is NOT covered by the
MIT License. Delete the shell/pets/ directory if you need an MIT-only tree; the UI falls back to built-in drawn shapes.

MIT 只覆盖本仓库的代码与文档。shell/pets/ 目录下的角色素材是第三方素材，采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，版权属于各自作者，
不在 MIT 范围内。需要纯 MIT 的树时，删掉 shell/pets/ 目录即可，界面会回落到自带的示意形象。
